  Name: Project Flow-Pure
  Type: 0
  Image: {fileID: 0}
  Description: "Project Flow-Pure is a pioneering subterranean overhaul designed
    to future-proof Eindhoven\u2019s hidden infrastructure for the next century.
    While District E transforms the skyline, Flow-Pure reclaims the city's depths
    by replacing aging 1950s pipes with a smart, modular circulatory system capable
    of supporting a high-density vertical city. By integrating AI-driven sensors
    and heat-recovery technology, this project does more than manage waste; it captures
    thermal energy from wastewater to provide sustainable heating for the very towers
    rising above it."
